<title>NEW ZEALAND: PDL not accepting bond oversubscriptions.</title>
<headline>PDL not accepting bond oversubscriptions.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>PDL Holdings Ltd said on Wednesday it would not be accepting oversubscriptions on its corporate bond issue.</p>
<p>This means the total issue amount will be NZ$20 million.</p>
<p>PDL announced in June it would issue up to NZ$35 million in corporate bonds.</p>
</text>
